it/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">B</span>.<a href=\"./Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Defs.html#Matrix.transpose\">transpose</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If the consistency SOS relation annihilates EPR, the local Alice and Bob matrices agree\nup to transpose:\n$$\n  A_{ij} = B_j^T.\n$$\n","docLink":"./LCS/EPR.html#consistency_of_epr_annihilates","kind":"theorem","line":561,"name":"consistency_of_epr_annihilates","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/EPR.lean#L561-L589"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#sos_sum_kills_epr_implies_terms_kill_epr\"><span class=\"name\">sos_sum_kills_epr_implies_terms_kill_epr</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">G</span> : <a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout\">LCSLayout</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">game</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSGame\">LCSGame</a> <span class=\"fn\">G</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Fintype/Defs.html#Fintype\">Fintype</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#DecidableEq\">DecidableEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">strat</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Strategy/ProjectorStrategy.html#LCSStrategy\">LCSStrategy</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Defs.html#Matrix\">Matrix</a> (<span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>) (<span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>) <a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Complex/Basic.html#Complex\">ℂ</a>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">G</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">G</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.r\">r</a></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <span class=\"fn\">↥<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">G</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.V\">V</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span>)</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">h</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">1</span> / <span class=\"fn\">8</span>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSMul.hSMul\">•</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#sosSquareSum\">sosSquareSum</a> <span class=\"fn\">game</span> <span class=\"fn\">strat</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span></span>).<a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Matrix/Mul.html#Matrix.mulVec\">mulVec</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#eprVec\">eprVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#sosConsistencyTerm\">sosConsistencyTerm</a> <span class=\"fn\">strat</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Matrix/Mul.html#Matrix.mulVec\">mulVec</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#eprVec\">eprVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a>   <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#sosRowTerm\">sosRowTerm</a> <span class=\"fn\">game</span> <span class=\"fn\">strat</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Matrix/Mul.html#Matrix.mulVec\">mulVec</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#eprVec\">eprVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#And\">∧</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#sosProductTerm\">sosProductTerm</a> <span class=\"fn\">game</span> <span class=\"fn\">strat</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Matrix/Mul.html#Matrix.mulVec\">mulVec</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#eprVec\">eprVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If the scaled SOS square-sum annihilates EPR, then each individual SOS relation term\nannihilates EPR:\n$$\n  \\frac18(T_1^2 + T_2^2 + T_3^2)\\Omega = 0\n    \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n  T_1\\Omega = T_2\\Omega = T_3\\Omega = 0 .\n$$\nHere $T_1 = 1 - B_jA_{ij}$, $T_2 = 1 - (-1)^{b_i}\\operatorname{Row}_i(A)$, and\n$T_3 = 1 - (-1)^{b_i}\\operatorname{Row}_i(A)A_{ij}B_j$.  This is the positivity step\nthat bridges the rewritten local-loss SOS identity from Stage 1 to the concrete local\nmatrix identities extracted in Stage 3.\n","docLink":"./LCS/EPR.html#sos_sum_kills_epr_implies_terms_kill_epr","kind":"theorem","line":501,"name":"sos_sum_kills_epr_implies_terms_kill_epr","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/EPR.lean#L501-L547"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">theorem</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#local_loss_kills_epr_sos_sum\"><span class=\"name\">local_loss_kills_epr_sos_sum</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">G</span> : <a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout\">LCSLayout</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">game</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSGame\">LCSGame</a> <span class=\"fn\">G</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">n</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_1)</span></span>\n<span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Fintype/Defs.html#Fintype\">Fintype</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#DecidableEq\">DecidableEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">strat</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Strategy/ProjectorStrategy.html#LCSStrategy\">LCSStrategy</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Defs.html#Matrix\">Matrix</a> (<span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>) (<span class=\"fn\">n</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Prod\">×</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>) <a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Complex/Basic.html#Complex\">ℂ</a>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">G</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">G</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.r\">r</a></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <span class=\"fn\">↥<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">G</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.V\">V</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span>)</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">hLoss</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/WinningCondition.html#local_loss_operator\">local_loss_operator</a> <span class=\"fn\">game</span> <span class=\"fn\">strat</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span>)</span>.<a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Matrix/Mul.html#Matrix.mulVec\">mulVec</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#eprVec\">eprVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">1</span> / <span class=\"fn\">8</span>)</span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#HSMul.hSMul\">•</a> <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#sosSquareSum\">sosSquareSum</a> <span class=\"fn\">game</span> <span class=\"fn\">strat</span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span> <span class=\"fn\">j</span></span>).<a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Matrix/Mul.html#Matrix.mulVec\">mulVec</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#eprVec\">eprVec</a> <span class=\"fn\">n</span>)</span></span> <a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Eq\">=</a> <span class=\"fn\">0</span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The part of the SOS pipeline that is purely a rewrite: if the local loss annihilates EPR,\nthen the SOS expression from `local_loss_sos` annihilates EPR.  Extracting each individual\nsquare term from this sum requires a positivity/norm argument.\n\nIn symbols, this is the formal rewrite step\n$$\n  L_{ij}\\Omega = 0\n    \\quad\\Longrightarrow\\quad\n  \\frac18\\,(T_1^2 + T_2^2 + T_3^2)\\Omega = 0,\n$$\nwhere the three $T_k$ are the SOS relation terms from `local_loss_sos`.\n","docLink":"./LCS/EPR.html#local_loss_kills_epr_sos_sum","kind":"theorem","line":331,"name":"local_loss_kills_epr_sos_sum","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/EPR.lean#L331-L350"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">noncomputable def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#sosSquareSum\"><span class=\"name\">sosSquareSum</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">G</span> : <a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout\">LCSLayout</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_2}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Fintype/Defs.html#Fintype\">Fintype</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#DecidableEq\">DecidableEq</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span></span>]</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">game</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSGame\">LCSGame</a> <span class=\"fn\">G</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">strat</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./LCS/Strategy/ProjectorStrategy.html#LCSStrategy\">LCSStrategy</a> <span class=\"fn\">(<a href=\"./Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Defs.html#Matrix\">Matrix</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Complex/Basic.html#Complex\">ℂ</a>)</span> <span class=\"fn\">G</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">i</span> : <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Fin\">Fin</a> <span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">G</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.r\">r</a></span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">j</span> : <span class=\"fn\">↥<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\"><span class=\"fn\">G</span>.<a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout.V\">V</a></span> <span class=\"fn\">i</span>)</span></span>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/LinearAlgebra/Matrix/Defs.html#Matrix\">Matrix</a> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <span class=\"fn\">m</span> <a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Complex/Basic.html#Complex\">ℂ</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The sum of squares appearing in the local-loss SOS decomposition. ","docLink":"./LCS/EPR.html#sosSquareSum","kind":"def","line":316,"name":"sosSquareSum","sourceLink":"https://github.com/sean-prz/lean/blob/d22cd063b437e364b0ca3c0e65dc5e07461a93fd/projects/LCS/LCS/EPR.lean#L316-L324"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">noncomputable def</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./LCS/EPR.html#sosProductTerm\"><span class=\"name\">sosProductTerm</span></a></span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">G</span> : <a href=\"./LCS/Basic.html#LCSLayout\">LCSLayout</a>}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">{<span class=\"fn\">m</span> : <a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a> u_2}</span></span>\n</span><span class=\"impl_arg\"><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">[<span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Mathlib/Data/Fintyp